<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Booming Lungs</ansi> mutation

Your chest deepens and resonating chambers grow behind your ribs —
when you raise your voice it fills a room and rattles the people in it.

